Package: parkeze-rs485
Version: @VERSION@-@BUILD@
Depends: lua, lua-libmodbus, lua-cjson, libuci-lua, libubox-lua
Source: parkeze
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@parkeze.com>
Architecture: all
Description: The board's RS485 port, and the Modbus devices on it.
 Feeds the power board's hardware watchdog, reads the battery, and polls the
 Modbus RTU devices configured in UCI, one request at a time on a port it alone
 opens, and reports what it read to parkeze.net. Only on boards that declare
 the port.
